# Allowed models for implementation

Implementation work in Cursor uses only:

- **Composer 2.5**
- **Grok 4.5** (Cursor Grok 4.5)

Review is separate: Claude (via the Claude app) reviews PRs — Cursor agents never perform or simulate that review.

## Agent behavior

- If the current session is not one of the allowed models, stop and tell the user to switch before continuing development work.
- When spawning subagents, only select Composer 2.5 or Grok 4.5.
